{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02903","headline":"奉和圣制过温汤 · 杨思玄","name":"奉和圣制过温汤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丰城观汉迹，温谷幸秦余。\n地接幽王垒，涂分郑国渠。\n风威肃文卫，日彩镜雕舆。\n远岫凝氛重，寒丛对影疎。\n回瞻汉章阙，佳气满宸居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨思玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}